.TH ZG01-CONTROL 1 "2026-11-02" "ZG01 Control 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zg01-control \- GTK4 control GUI for the Yamaha ZG01 audio interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zg01-control
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zg01-control
is the standalone GTK4/libadwaita companion for the Yamaha ZG01. It talks to
the ALSA control device exposed by the
.B snd-zg01
kernel driver; it does not access USB directly and never needs root.
.PP
The window has three screens. \fBMixage\fR shows the MIC, VOICE and GAME
stream sends, the STREAM OUT switches and meter, and the preset bar.
\fBMicro\fR shows the GATE, COMP, LIMIT and four-band EQ chain.
\fBAvancé\fR lists every ALSA control the curated screens do not
claim.
.PP
Direct MIC fields come from the MIC state dump read at probe, by the
\fBRead from ZG01\fR action, and automatically after \fBReset\fR. The
transformed MIC fields and the non-MIC sections come from the driver cache;
their displayed values stay until the control is written again. Use
\fBSave\fR to persist the current values on the ZG01; \fBReset\fR reloads
the persisted settings and starts a fresh state read.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ZG01_LOCALEDIR
Directory containing the gettext catalogue
.RI ( fr/LC_MESSAGES/zg01-control.mo ).
The binary otherwise looks next to its installation prefix, then at
.IR target/locale
in a source tree, then at
.IR /usr/share/locale .
.TP
.B LANG
Standard locale selection; set
.B LANG=fr_FR.UTF-8
for the shipped French translation.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/applications/io.github.bsauvajon.Zg01Control.desktop
Desktop entry.
.TP
.I /usr/share/metainfo/io.github.bsauvajon.Zg01Control.metainfo.xml
AppStream metadata.
.TP
.I /usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/io.github.bsauvajon.Zg01Control.svg
Application icon.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zgctl (1),
.BR amixer (1)
.PP
The hardware acceptance checklist and the GUI documentation are in the
upstream repository:
.I https://github.com/bsauvajon/snd-zg01
